  "root_causes": [
    "Both exception-aware QoreString lookup overloads ignored the converted key and used the original encoded bytes.",
    "Conversion and invalid-hashdecl-member errors could return without assigning the exists output."
  ],
  "fixes": [
    "Use the temporary default-encoding key for both lookup APIs.",
    "Assign false to exists on both error paths."
  ],
